---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PostList from '../components/PostList.astro';
import CategoryTree from '../components/CategoryTree.astro';
import { publishedPosts } from '../lib/blog';

const posts = publishedPosts(await getCollection('posts'));
const featured = posts.filter((post) => post.data.featured).slice(0, 3);
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="hero page-shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">MAPLE'S NOTES · 2026</p>
    <h1>你好，我是 Maple。<br /><span>在这里记录技术，也整理生活。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">关于软件开发、AI 学习，以及那些值得慢下来想一想的事。</p>
    <div class="hero-actions">
      <a class="button primary" href="/posts/">开始阅读</a>
      <a class="button quiet" href="/about/">关于我 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-shell home-grid">
    <section class="home-main" aria-labelledby="featured-heading">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">FEATURED</p>
          <h2 id="featured-heading">精选文章</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="/posts/">查看全部 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
      <PostList posts={featured} />
    </section>

    <aside class="home-sidebar" aria-labelledby="browse-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">LIBRARY</p>
      <h2 id="browse-heading">按目录浏览</h2>
      <p class="aside-copy">文章按照主题逐级归档，像打开文件夹一样找到你想读的内容。</p>
      <CategoryTree posts={posts} />
    </aside>
  </div>

  <section class="statement">
    <div class="page-shell statement-inner">
      <p>“写作不是为了给生活一个答案，而是让那些模糊的想法慢慢变得清楚。”</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
